& [IR2ParserProjectionFixturePlanV1] is the IR2-S07 fixture and expected-output ledger plan for parser/projection proof
  + [fixture_plan_id] is ir2-parser-projection-fixture-plan-v1
  + [fixture_plan_uuid] is 7f178e8b-e8cb-4520-9e82-53a8254922f0
  + [slice_id] is IR2-S07
  + [plan_status] is accepted_by_completion_review_pending
  + [model_route_used] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after IR2-S01 through IR2-S06 are accepted and fixture scope is bounded
  + [implementation_scope] is fixture and expected-ledger plan only

  = must: define fixture source records, expected KernelRecord ledgers, expected SQLite projection ledgers, stale and invalid source cases, and no-authority-promotion proof checks
  = must: keep fixture source and expected ledgers tracked as SOP authority while generated outputs remain disposable projections
  - never: implement parser code, create generated SQLite databases, install dependencies, or authorize operations control in this slice

& [FixtureDirectoryPlan] is the directory plan for future IR2 fixture material
  + [fixture_source_root] is tests/fixtures/sop/ir2_parser_projection/
  + [fixture_expected_root] is tests/fixtures/expected/ir2_parser_projection/
  + [fixture_generated_root] is tests/fixtures/generated/ir2_parser_projection/
  + [fixture_source_status] is tracked SOP fixture source
  + [fixture_expected_status] is tracked SOP expected-output ledger
  + [fixture_generated_status] is generated_projection_only

  = must: track only fixture source and expected ledgers
  = must: ignore generated outputs and make them rebuildable

& [FixtureCaseSet] is the bounded fixture case set for first IR2 implementation proof
  + [fixture_case] is valid_signed_canonical_artifact
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves SJS signature, source hash, source manifest, and authority_artifact classification path
  + [fixture_case] is source_only_unprocessed_artifact
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves preserved source remains source_only without false signed_sjs promotion
  + [fixture_case] is missing_signature_canonical_artifact
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves missing signature blocks trust-bearing authority classification
  + [fixture_case] is wrong_protocol_signature
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves nonmatching signature protocol becomes fault output
  + [fixture_case] is stale_source_hash
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves hash mismatch produces stale_projection or invalidation output
  + [fixture_case] is malformed_sop_structure
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves parser faults preserve raw line evidence and block affected authority classification
  + [fixture_case] is unresolved_natural_key
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves unresolved identity remains blocked with rationale
  + [fixture_case] is broken_lineage
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves missing source manifest or registry edge produces fault output
  + [fixture_case] is generated_projection_non_authority
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves generated SQLite, cache, or parser output cannot satisfy authority requirements
  + [fixture_case] is source_mutation_refusal
  + [fixture_case_purpose] is proves parser/projection workflow refuses source mutation and reports a fault

  = must: keep fixture cases small enough for deterministic review
  = must: require a future review before adding cases outside this bounded set

